  "contentPlaintext": "<bold>Team Meeting Notes</bold>\nThis internal log captures daily alignment, task updates, technical dependencies, and internal peer reviews during weekly team syncs.\n<bold>1. Table of Contents</bold>\n1. Table of Contents\n2. Session Metadata\n3. Task Burndown & Stand-up Status\n4. Technical Impediments & Blockers\n5. Sprint Adjustments & Internal Deadlines\n6. Next Internal Sync Schedule\n<bold>2. Session Metadata</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Title:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Project Name]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Meeting Date / Time:</textStyle></bold> [Insert Date] | [Insert Time]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Session ID:</textStyle></bold> MTG-TEAM-[001-999]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Facilitator:</textStyle></bold> [Project Lead Name]\n<bold>Attendance Roll Call</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Project Lead (Manager):</textStyle></bold> [Present / Absent]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Student Team Members:</textStyle></bold> [List names and attendance state]\n<bold>3. Task Burndown & Stand-up Status</bold>\nEach team member summarizes their progress since the last meeting, their goals for the next cycle, and any current roadblocks:\n<bold>Project Lead</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Completed:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Prepared supervisor milestone presentation, reviewed PRs]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Next Up:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Finalizing requirements mapping matrix]\n<bold>Student 2 (Frontend/UI)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Completed:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Designed Figma wireframes for user authentication]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Next Up:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Converting wireframes to React components]\n<bold>Student 3 (Backend/Database)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Completed:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Configured Docker local environment, drafted Prisma schemas]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Next Up:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Setting up API endpoints for authentication]\n<bold>Student 4 (DevOps/QA)</bold>\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Completed:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Configured GitHub Actions CI pipeline linting check]\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">Next Up:</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Creating unit test suites for authentication logic]\n<bold>4. Technical Impediments & Blockers</bold>\nThis section records critical blockers that require team brainstorming or supervisor intervention:\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">          Blocker 1 (Technical):</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Third-party OAuth API requires a verified domain name, which stalls local testing.]\n<italic>Resolution / Action:</italic> [Student 4] will configure mock environment variables by [Date].\n<bold><textStyle color=\"\" fontFamily=\"\" fontSize=\"null\">          Blocker 2 (Resource):</textStyle></bold> [e.g., Awaiting official faculty API key credentials.]\n<italic>Resolution / Action:</italic> Project Lead to request access from the Teaching Assistant via email.\n<bold>5. Sprint Adjustments & Internal Deadlines</bold>\nAction items mapped to the internal task board to prepare for upcoming academic reviews:\nAction Item / Task\nAssigned Owner\nPriority\nTarget Tag\nInternal Deadline\n<italic>[e.g., Review open pull requests]</italic>\n[Project Lead]\nHigh\n<code>review</code>\n[Date]\n<italic>[e.g., Fix database migration bug]</italic>\n[Student 3]\nHigh\n<code>implementation</code>\n[Date]\n<italic>[e.g., Research JWT refresh token strategies]</italic>\n[Student 2]\nMedium\n<code>research</code>\n[Date]\n<bold>6. Next Internal Sync Schedule</bold>\n<bold>Target Date / Time:</bold> [Insert Date] | [Insert Time]\n<bold>Meeting Objective:</bold> [e.g., Final code review before official Project Proposal submission]",
